        content: `# Day 8: AI for Your Resume 📄\n\n## Stand Out from the Stack\n\nRecruiters spend an average of **7 seconds** on each resume. AI can help you make every word count.\n\n## Resume Power-Ups\n\n### Bullet Point Improver\n\`\`\`\nImprove these resume bullet points to be more impactful.\nUse strong action verbs and quantify results where possible.\nI'm applying for [role] at [type of company].\n\nOriginal bullets:\n- [paste your bullets]\n\`\`\`\n\n### Skills Gap Analyzer\n\`\`\`\nHere's a job description: [paste it]\nHere are my skills: [list yours]\n\nIdentify:\n1. Skills I have that match\n2. Skills I'm missing\n3. How to highlight transferable skills\n\`\`\`\n\n### Before & After\n\n❌ "Helped with social media"\n✅ "Managed Instagram content calendar, growing engagement by 40% over 3 months"\n\n❌ "Did data entry"\n✅ "Processed 200+ records daily with 99.5% accuracy, streamlining the onboarding pipeline"\n\n## Formatting Tips\n- One page for junior roles\n- Most relevant experience first\n- Tailor for EACH job application\n- Use keywords from the job description\n\n> 🎯 **Pro tip**: Paste the job description into AI and ask "What keywords should my resume include?"`
