        content: `# Day 1: The AI Side Gig Landscape 💰\n\nWelcome to the 14-Day AI Side Gigs Challenge! By Day 14, you'll have a real, launchable side gig.\n\n## Why AI Side Gigs?\n\n- **Low startup cost** — Most AI tools have free tiers\n- **High demand** — Businesses desperately need AI-savvy people\n- **Scalable** — AI lets you do the work of a small team\n- **Location-free** — Work from anywhere with WiFi\n\n## Top AI Side Gigs in 2026\n\n| Gig | Earning Potential | Difficulty |\n|-----|-------------------|------------|\n| AI Content Writing | $500–$3,000/mo | ⭐ Easy |\n| Social Media Management | $1,000–$5,000/mo | ⭐⭐ Medium |\n| AI Consulting | $2,000–$10,000/mo | ⭐⭐⭐ Advanced |\n| Prompt Engineering | $1,000–$8,000/mo | ⭐⭐ Medium |\n| AI-Powered Design | $500–$4,000/mo | ⭐⭐ Medium |\n| Chatbot Building | $1,500–$7,000/mo | ⭐⭐⭐ Advanced |\n| AI Tutoring/Training | $1,000–$5,000/mo | ⭐⭐ Medium |\n\n## The Side Gig Formula\n\n**Your Skills + AI Tools + A Real Problem = Profitable Side Gig**\n\nYou don't need to be an AI expert. You need to be someone who solves problems USING AI.\n\n> 💡 **Key insight**: The highest-paid AI freelancers aren't the most technical — they're the best at understanding what clients actually need.`
