        content: `# Day 2: Find Your Niche 🎯\n\n## The Niche Sweet Spot\n\nThe best side gig sits at the intersection of:\n1. **What you know** — Your existing skills and interests\n2. **What people pay for** — Real market demand\n3. **What AI accelerates** — Where AI gives you superpowers\n\n## Niche Finder Exercise\n\nUse this prompt to brainstorm:\n\n\`\`\`\nI want to start an AI-powered side gig. Help me find my niche.\n\nMy background: [your job/skills/education]\nMy interests: [hobbies, passions]\nTime available: [hours per week]\nIncome goal: [monthly target]\n\nSuggest 10 specific side gig ideas that combine my \nskills with AI tools. For each, include:\n- What I'd actually do\n- Who would pay for it\n- How much I could charge\n- Which AI tools I'd use\n- How to get my first client\n\`\`\`\n\n## Niche Validation Checklist\n\n✅ Can you find 10+ potential clients in 5 minutes of searching?\n✅ Are people already paying for this service (without AI)?\n✅ Does AI genuinely make you faster/better at this?\n✅ Can you explain the value in one sentence?\n✅ Would you enjoy doing this for 5+ hours/week?\n\n## Popular Niches by Background\n\n- **Writers** → AI content agency, newsletter ghostwriting\n- **Designers** → AI-assisted branding packages\n- **Marketers** → AI social media management\n- **Teachers** → AI tutoring, course creation\n- **Tech-savvy** → Chatbot building, automation setups\n\n> 🎯 **Pick a niche, not a tool.** "I help real estate agents create listings faster with AI" beats "I use ChatGPT."`
