        content: `# Day 4: Create Your Service Package 📦\n\n## Packaging = Professionalism\n\nClients buy **packages**, not hours. A clear package makes you look professional and simplifies the buying decision.\n\n## The 3-Tier Model\n\n### Example: AI Content Writing Gig\n\n| | Basic | Standard | Premium |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **Price** | $150/mo | $400/mo | $900/mo |\n| Blog posts | 2/month | 4/month | 8/month |\n| Social posts | — | 8/month | 16/month |\n| SEO optimization | — | ✅ | ✅ |\n| Strategy call | — | — | Monthly |\n| Revisions | 1 round | 2 rounds | Unlimited |\n\n## Build Your Package\n\n\`\`\`\nHelp me create a 3-tier service package for my \n[type of gig] side gig.\n\nTarget client: [who you serve]\nMy time available: [hours/week]\nSkill level: [beginner/intermediate]\n\nCreate Basic, Standard, and Premium tiers with:\n- Clear deliverables for each tier\n- Pricing (research competitive rates)\n- What makes each tier worth upgrading to\n- A catchy name for each tier\n\`\`\`\n\n## Pricing Psychology\n\n- **Anchor high** — The Premium tier makes Standard look affordable\n- **Most buy Standard** — That's your "sweet spot" tier\n- **Value, not time** — Charge for the output, not the hours\n- **Start competitive** — Raise prices after getting 3-5 testimonials\n\n## Don't Forget\n- What's included (be specific)\n- What's NOT included (prevents scope creep)\n- Turnaround time\n- Payment terms\n\n> 💰 **Mindset shift**: You're not selling your time. You're selling a transformation or result.`
